  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "碩士論文",
    "sub_ename": "MASTER THESIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是數據科學碩士學位學程的必要課程。課程的目的是讓學生學習撰寫數據科學相關的碩士論文。學生必須選擇一位教師作為主要的指導教授。透過本課程，學生應該發展一項數據科學領域相關之研究項目，收集、調查和分析研究問題，並呈現其研究結果。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is required for the Master’s Program of Data Science. The purpose of the course is for the student to write a master's thesis in data science. Students must choose a faculty member as a primary advisor to work with. During this course, the student should develop a research project to collect, investigate, and analyze a research question within the field of data science and present the results of your study.",
